<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend Comms started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend Comms started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it started coverage of Ascend Communications Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-month target price of 78.</p>
<p>-- Said expects Ascend's new product offerings to maintain the company's leadership position in the remote access server market.</p>
<p>-- Estimates Ascend's earnings at $0.97 per share in 1996, $1.41 per share in 1997 and $1.96 per share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-5/8 to 65-1/8 in midday stock exchange activity.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
